    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "落库的三道闸",
      "items": [
        "before_memory_write 钩子：BLOCK 则不落库，payload 可改写内容（core.py:1562）",
        "allows_write：max_writes_per_run 频次、min_write_length、write_fingerprint 指纹去重（protocol.py:409）",
        "_requires_memory_promotion：内部 source/scope（reflection、agent、swarm 等）必须走晋升审核（core.py:1653）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "「可注入」由晋升裁决授予",
      "items": [
        "allows_promotion 无回调默认 keep；钩子 payload 可直接给出裁决（protocol.py:463）",
        "promote 后经 _store_memory_record 落库并标记 injectable=true；否则候选置 rejected/kept",
        "检索侧 allows_result 会拦截未晋升/不可注入的内部记忆，形成落库→检索闭环（protocol.py:352）"
      ]
    }
